{"title":"SANDA(산다)","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=rjZhp/hAdNTFt3FJ/Nt9MlgIRgakVxDbpdSUKkK&filename=th3","synopsis":"이것은 가까운 미래, 초저출산 시대의 이야기. \n\n「트라우마 제로 교육」을 표방하는 완전 기숙사제 학교, 다이코쿠 애호 학원에서 \n1명의 소녀가 행방불명된다. \n충분한 수사 없이 사망 처리된 것에 의문을 품은 \n후유무라 시오리는 어느 소년에게 수사 협력을 의뢰한다. \n소년의 이름은 산다 카즈시게. \n그가 감추고 있는 \"어느 저주\"의 힘을 믿고.\n\n「어른」과 「어린이」.\n그 기묘한 관계성을 그린 이색 휴먼 드라마.\n\nSANDA ©2021 PARU ITAGAKI (AKITASHOTEN JAPAN)","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":250,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":106559,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":106567,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":106569,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":106580,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":106580,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":106586,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":106595,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":106606,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":106617,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":106620,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":106627,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":106631,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":106635,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":106644,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":106652,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461},{"date":"2026-10-26","v":106661,"rc":1479,"rs":14356,"cc":461}]}